sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Caller A
    participant B as Caller B
    participant SF as SingleFlight
    participant SAC as safeApiCall
    A->>SF: run(user:me)
    SF->>SF: no entry, create Deferred, store
    SF->>SAC: GET /me (once)
    B->>SF: run(user:me)
    SF-->>B: await existing Deferred (no new call)
    SAC-->>SF: Outcome.Success(user)
    SF->>SF: remove entry
    SF-->>A: result
    SF-->>B: same result
